    <li>questName-&gt;[insects] warte [itemPodsTotalMarketValue_money]</li>
    <li>questName(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True)-&gt;Spektakl w wykonaniu [insects2]</li>
    <li>questName(p=0.3)-&gt;rój</li>
    <li>insects-&gt;insekty</li>
    <li>insects-&gt;robaki</li>
