    <li>insects2-&gt;robaków</li>
    <li>insects2-&gt;gniazd</li>
  </ThreatReward_Infestation_ItemPod.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>animalKindLabelCorrect(animalCount==1)->[animalKind_label]</li>
    <li>animalKindLabelCorrect(animalCount>=2)->[animalKind_labelPlural]</li>
    <li>manhuntingBeastIndef(animalCount==1)->a (*Threat)manhunting [animalKind_label](/Threat)</li>
    <li>manhuntingBeastIndef(animalCount>=2)->a pack of (*Threat)[animalCount] manhunting [animalKind_labelPlural](/Threat)</li>
    <li>endSection->[helpersParagraph]The [animalKindLabelCorrect] will arrive at [map_definite] [manhuntersDelayTicks_duration] after you accept.</li>
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true,animalCount==1)->A trader is calling. (*Threat)A wild [animalKind_label](/Threat) is hunting him! He wants your help to draw the beast away from him.[endSection]</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(askerIsNull==true,animalCount==1)->The [animalKind_label] was hunting a nearby trader.</li>
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true,animalCount>=2)->A trader is calling. A pack of (*Threat)[animalCount] wild [animalKind_labelPlural](/Threat) are hunting him! He wants your help to draw the animals away from him.[endSection]</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(askerIsNull==true,animalCount>=2)->The [animalKind_labelPlural] were hunting a nearby trader.</li>
    <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->Caravans of [asker_faction_name] are being harassed by [manhuntingBeastIndef]. [asker_faction_leaderTitle] [asker_nameFull] wants your help to draw the beasts away from the caravans.[endSection]</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(asker_factionLeader==True,animalCount==1)->The [animalKind_label] was harassing caravans from [asker_faction_name].</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(asker_factionLeader==True,animalCount>=2)->The [animalKind_labelPlural] were harassing caravans from [asker_faction_name].</li>
    <li>questDescription(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True,animalCount==1)->[asker_nameFull], a [asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction] of [asker_faction_name], recently lost a scout to (*Threat)a manhunting [animalKind_label](/Threat). [asker_pronoun] wants to draw it towards you to be killed, to uphold [asker_possessive] honor.[endSection]</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True,animalCount==1)->This is the [animalKind_label] that killed the scout of the [asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction] [asker_nameFull] of [asker_faction_name].</li>
    <li>questDescription(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True,animalCount>=2)->[asker_nameFull], a [asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction] of [asker_faction_name], recently lost a scouting party to a pack of (*Threat)[animalCount] manhunting [animalKind_labelPlural](/Threat). [asker_pronoun] wants to draw the beasts towards you to be killed, to uphold [asker_possessive] honor.[endSection]</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True,animalCount>=2)->These are the [animalKind_labelPlural] that killed the scouting party of the [asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction] [asker_nameFull] of [asker_faction_name].</li>
  -->
  <ThreatReward_Manhunters_ItemPod.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>animalKindLabelCorrect(animalCount==1)-&gt;[animalKind_label]</li>
    <li>animalKindLabelCorrect(animalCount&gt;=2)-&gt;[animalKind_labelPlural]</li>
    <li>manhuntingBeastIndef(animalCount==1)-&gt;(*Threat)jedno rozjuszone zwierzę: [animalKind_label](/Threat)</li>
    <li>manhuntingBeastIndef(animalCount&gt;=2)-&gt;(*Threat)stado rozjuszonych zwierząt: [animalCount] [animalKind_labelPlural](/Threat)</li>
    <li>endSection(animalCount==1)-&gt;[helpersParagraph]\n\nZwierzę [animalKind_label] pojawi się w [map_definite] po [manhuntersDelayTicks_duration] od przyjęcia zadania.</li>
    <li>endSection(animalCount&gt;=2)-&gt;[helpersParagraph]\n\nStado zwierząt ([animalKind_labelPlural]) pojawi się w [map_definite] po [manhuntersDelayTicks_duration] od przyjęcia zadania.</li>
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true,animalCount==1)-&gt;Kupiec nadaje sygnał alarmowy. Ściga go (*Threat)rozjuszone zwierzę: [animalKind_label](/Threat). Prosi o odciągnięcie napastnika.[endSection]</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(askerIsNull==true,animalCount==1)-&gt;Zwierzę [animalKind_label] ścigało pobliskiego kupca.</li>
    <li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true,animalCount&gt;=2)-&gt;Kupiec nadaje sygnał alarmowy. Ściga go (*Threat)stado rozjuszonych zwierząt: [animalCount] [animalKind_labelPlural](/Threat). Prosi o odciągnięcie zwierząt.[endSection]</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(askerIsNull==true,animalCount&gt;=2)-&gt;Stado [animalKind_labelPlural] ścigało pobliskiego kupca.</li>
    <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)-&gt;Karawany frakcji [asker_faction_name] są atakowane przez [manhuntingBeastIndef]. Przywódca [asker_nameFull] (tytuł: [asker_faction_leaderTitle]) prosi o odciągnięcie niebezpieczeństwa od swoich ludzi.[endSection]</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(asker_factionLeader==True,animalCount==1)-&gt;Zwierzę [animalKind_label] atakowało karawany frakcji [asker_faction_name].</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(asker_factionLeader==True,animalCount&gt;=2)-&gt;Stado [animalKind_labelPlural] atakowało karawany frakcji [asker_faction_name].</li>
    <li>questDescription(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True,animalCount==1)-&gt;[asker_nameFull] (tytuł: [asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction], frakcja: [asker_faction_name]) prosi o pomoc. Niedawno zwiadowca zleceniodawcy zginął wskutek ataku (*Threat)rozjuszonego zwierzęcia: [animalKind_label](/Threat). Zleceniodawca chce zwabić zwierzę do twojej kolonii i zabić je na znak swojej potęgi.[endSection]</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True,animalCount==1)-&gt;To zwierzę ([animalKind_label]) zabiło zwiadowcę ze świty zleceniodawcy z frakcji [asker_faction_name].</li>
    <li>questDescription(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True,animalCount&gt;=2)-&gt;[asker_nameFull] (tytuł: [asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction], frakcja: [asker_faction_name]) prosi o pomoc. Niedawno oddział zwiadowczy zleceniodawcy zginął wskutek ataku (*Threat)stada [animalCount] rozjuszonych zwierząt: [animalKind_labelPlural](/Threat). Zleceniodawca chce zwabić stado do twojej kolonii i je zniszczyć na znak swojej potęgi.[endSection]</li>
    <li>manhunterArrivalLetterEnd(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True,animalCount&gt;=2)-&gt;To stado ([animalKind_labelPlural]) zabiło zwiadowców ze świty zleceniodawcy z frakcji [asker_faction_name].</li>
  </ThreatReward_Manhunters_ItemPod.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
